{"content":"h11.\n\nLooking at the persistent entity types in the `store` package (the data layer: `store/memo.go`, `store/user.go`, `store/attachment.go`, `store/reaction.go`, `store/inbox.go`, `store/idp.go`, `store/memo_relation.go`, `store/memo_share.go`, `store/user_identity.go`), and tracing outward references via `store.\u003cType\u003e` usage across non-`store` packages:\n\n- **store.User** is referenced from: `server/auth`, `server/notification`, `server/router/api/v1` (+ its `test` subpackage), `server/router/fileserver`, `server/router/frontend`, `server/router/rss` — **~7 packages**\n- **store.Memo** is referenced from: `server/notification`, `server/router/api/v1` (+`test`), `server/router/frontend`, `server/router/rss`, `server/runner/memopayload` — **~6 packages**\n\nOther candidates trail well behind: `store.Attachment` (~4: `server/router/api/v1`+test, `server/router/fileserver`, `server/router/rss`), `store.MemoRelation`/`store.MemoShare`/`store.Inbox` (~3 each), `store.Reaction`/`store.UserIdentity` (~2 each), and `store.IdentityProvider` (effectively 0 outside the data layer — only consumed within `store/db/*`).\n\n**1st: User (~7 packages); 2nd: Memo (~6 packages)**\n\nCitations: `store/user.go:29` (User struct), `store/memo.go:35` (Memo struct); usage evidence e.g. `server/auth/authenticator.go:61,136,190`, `server/router/fileserver/fileserver.go:708,715`, `server/router/rss/rss.go:162,210` for User; `server/notification/email.go:213-306`, `server/runner/memopayload/runner.go:74`, `server/router/rss/rss.go:162` for Memo.","iteration":10,"turn":1,"type":"assistant"}
